Boost 1.89 removed the compiled boost_system library; boost::system is
header-only and no longer a find_package() component. Drop it from the
required components.

Upstream-Status: Pending

--- a/analyzer/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/analyzer/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -89,7 +89,7 @@
 endif()
 
 find_package(Boost 1.55.0 REQUIRED
-             COMPONENTS filesystem system thread)
+             COMPONENTS filesystem thread)
 include_directories(SYSTEM ${Boost_INCLUDE_DIRS})
 
 find_package(PkgConfig REQUIRED)
